<section class="blackground-club-page">
  <nav class="club-top-nav">
    <a class="club-nav-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">← Blackground</a>

    <a class="club-nav-logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="Blackground home">
      <img
        src="{{ 'blackground_logo_text.png' | asset_url }}"
        alt="Blackground"
        loading="eager"
      >
    </a>

    <a class="club-nav-link" href="{{ section.settings.quiz_link }}">
      Take the Check
    </a>
  </nav>

  <main class="club-main">
    <section class="club-hero" data-screen-label="01 Hero">
      <div class="club-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="club-card-label">
          <div class="top">
            <span class="wordmark">BLACKGROUND</span>
            <span class="num">#047</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="name">Daniel Okafor</div>
            <div class="row">
              <span>Founder · Spring 26</span>
              <span>Lifetime Rate</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="club-hero-inner">
        <div class="club-eyebrow">The Blackground Club</div>

        <h1 class="club-hero-title">
          A small room<br>
          with a <span class="gold">door</span>.
        </h1>

        <p class="club-hero-tag">
          A founding rate of $29 a month. Locked in for as long as you stay. You'll know within 90 seconds if it's for you.
        </p>

        <div class="club-cta-row">
          <a class="club-btn-primary" href="{{ section.settings.join_link }}">
            Join the Spring '26 Cohort
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 6h8M7 2l4 4-4 4"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <span class="club-status">Live · Spring '26</span>
        </div>

        <p class="club-hero-meta">
          We open in cohorts. The <strong>Spring '26</strong> cohort opens <strong>June 14</strong>. 500 members admitted, then we close.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-proof" aria-label="Proof">
      <div class="club-proof-cell cell-dinner" aria-label="Founders' Dinner"></div>

      <div class="club-proof-cell cell-card" aria-label="Member card">
        <div class="mini-card">
          <div class="top">
            <span>BLACKGROUND</span>
            <span>#047</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bottom">Daniel O.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="club-proof-cell cell-pub" aria-label="Blackgrounds Vol. 1">
        <div class="pub-cover">
          <div class="top">Blackgrounds</div>
          <div class="title">A Quiet Storm,<br>in Eight Frames</div>
          <div class="vol">Volume One · Spring '26</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="club-proof-cell cell-briefing" aria-label="Quarterly Briefing in hand"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">What this is</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        A membership for the people who <span class="gold">already understood the name</span> when they heard it.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-prose">
        <p>It's the room behind the brand. It's where the next drop happens before the public sees it. It's the people on the receiving end of a quarterly publication you can't get anywhere else. It's a numbered metal card that says where you got in line.</p>

        <p class="negation">It is not a discount program. It is not a marketing tier. It is not the kind of "membership" that gets sold to everyone who lands on a website.</p>

        <p class="close">A small room. With a door.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">What members get</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        Six things, in order of <span class="gold">how often you'll use them</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-benefits-grid">
        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">01</div>
          <h3>Early access to every drop.</h3>
          <p>24 hours before the public. The pieces you actually wanted, before they sold out for everyone else.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">02</div>
          <h3>15% off everything. Always.</h3>
          <p>Not a one-time code. The Club rate, every order, no exceptions. The membership pays for itself on a single hoodie purchase every three months.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">03</div>
          <h3>The quarterly <em>Blackgrounds</em> Briefing.</h3>
          <p>Our publication, mailed to your door. 20+ pages, four times a year. Portraits, essays, commissioned writing from Black voices we believe in. Members receive the print edition; nobody else does.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">04</div>
          <h3>One physical perk per quarter.</h3>
          <p>A patch, a bandana, a tote, a print, a pair of socks — small objects, member-only, marked with your member number. Things you'll keep.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">05</div>
          <h3>A numbered metal card.</h3>
          <p>Heavyweight. Engraved with your name and your member number. It's not a prop. It's the evidence.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-benefit">
          <div class="benefit-num">06</div>
          <h3>Members-only events and pop-ups.</h3>
          <p>Private shopping hours before public openings. Founders' Dinners. Atlanta, Brooklyn, Houston, DC, Lagos, London — wherever the membership goes, the events follow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">How it works</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        Four steps. Then you're <span class="gold">in the room</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-how-grid">
        <div class="club-how-step">
          <div class="how-num">01</div>
          <h4>Join during an open cohort.</h4>
          <p>We admit members in cohorts, twice a year. Your member number is permanent — Spring '26 founders are #001–#500 forever.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-how-step">
          <div class="how-num">02</div>
          <h4>Your founding rate is locked.</h4>
          <p>$29/month for as long as you stay. The price goes up with every cohort. You keep the rate of the door you walked through.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-how-step">
          <div class="how-num">03</div>
          <h4>Your welcome kit ships within 7 days.</h4>
          <p>Numbered metal card. Handwritten note. The current issue of <em>Blackgrounds</em>. A small first-quarter perk.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-how-step">
          <div class="how-num">04</div>
          <h4>You stay until you don't.</h4>
          <p>Cancel any time, no questions, no reactivation fee if you come back. The door doesn't lock behind you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block club-math">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">The math</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        In case you're <span class="gold">working it out</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-prose">
        <p>$29/month is $348 a year. The 15% off pays for the membership in a single hoodie purchase every three months. The print <em>Blackgrounds</em> alone is worth $60 a year if you bought it issue by issue. The early access saves you from missing the drops you actually wanted. The quarterly perks are not trivial. The metal card is a permanent object.</p>

        <p><span class="pay-back">If you're already a customer, the membership is cheaper than not being one.</span> If you're not yet, the Club is how most of our long-term customers started.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block club-note">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">A note from us</div>

      <div class="club-prose">
        <p>We built the Club because we wanted somewhere to send the people who got the joke in the brand name without us having to explain it.</p>
        <p>If that's you, you're in the right place. If it's not, no harm — we'll be here.</p>
        <span class="signature">— The Founders, Blackground</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">Members on the Club</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        Founding members, in <span class="gold">their own words</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-voices-grid">
        <div class="club-voice">
          <p>It's the only membership I've kept past 90 days. The Briefing alone is worth it.</p>
          <div>Daniel <span>· Brooklyn, NY</span> <em>#047</em></div>
        </div>

        <div class="club-voice">
          <p>I bought my dad a copy of Volume 1. He read it twice.</p>
          <div>Amara <span>· Atlanta, GA</span> <em>#112</em></div>
        </div>

        <div class="club-voice">
          <p>I joined for the early access. I stayed for the dinner.</p>
          <div>Kwame <span>· Houston, TX</span> <em>#218</em></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-block">
      <div class="club-eyebrow">Questions you might have</div>

      <h2 class="club-section-title">
        Short answers. <span class="gold">Real questions</span>.
      </h2>

      <div class="club-faq-list">
        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>What if I don't take the quiz first?</summary>
          <div>You don't have to. The Club is open to anyone. The quiz just helps us send you the right things.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>What if I cancel and want to come back?</summary>
          <div>You can. Your member number is preserved if you rejoin within 12 months. Your founding rate is preserved if you rejoin within the same cohort window.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>What if my kit doesn't arrive?</summary>
          <div>Reply to your welcome email. A real person will fix it within 24 hours.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>What if I'm not in the U.S.?</summary>
          <div>The Club ships worldwide. International members pay a flat shipping supplement on top of the membership rate.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>Why cohorts?</summary>
          <div>Because we want every member to feel like they walked through a specific door at a specific time. Member #047 means something.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>Can I gift a membership?</summary>
          <div>Yes. At checkout, select “this is a gift.” We'll mail the welcome kit to the recipient with a personalized note.</div>
        </details>

        <details class="club-faq">
          <summary>Will you ever raise the founding rate?</summary>
          <div>Not on existing members. Your rate is locked for as long as you stay. New cohorts pay the going rate when they join.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="club-final" id="join">
      <h2>
        The Spring '26 cohort<br>
        opens <span class="gold">June 14</span>.
      </h2>

      <p>500 members admitted, then we close.</p>

      <a class="club-btn-primary" href="{{ section.settings.join_link }}">
        Join the Spring '26 Cohort
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 6h8M7 2l4 4-4 4"/>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <small>If you're not ready, the next window opens <strong>October 4</strong>. We'll be here.</small>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="club-footer">
    <span class="footer-sig">A small room with a door. — Blackground</span>

    <ul>
      <li><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="/collections/all">Shop</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ section.settings.quiz_link }}">The Check</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>

    <span class="footer-copy">© 2026 Blackground</span>
  </footer>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  .blackground-club-page,
